I Collect Fee Mode</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 197px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 197px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP DELED Admission : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on 01/07/2026</span></span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>35 Years</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation as per UPDELED 2026-2028 Admissions Rules/</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Uttar Pradesh UPDELED (BTC)</span> : Admission Details 2026</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"4\"><strong>UPDELED&nbsp; Eligibility 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>UP DELEd (2 Year BTC)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with at Least 50% Minimum Marks.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">For SC / ST Candidates : 45%.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Apply UPDELEd 2 Year Course Admission Online Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Uttar Pradesh government has released the GO of 2026 this year for 2 years DELED whose old name was UPBTC.</li>\n<li>This year the online applications for admission will start from <strong>15 June 2026,</strong> the last date is <strong>08 July 2026.</strong> for Apply Online Visit .</li>\n<li>The entrance exam will not be held this year, this year the admission in Uttar Pradesh DELED will be on the basis of merit.</li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Applying the Recruitment Application Form in UP DELED BTC Admission 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px; width: 34.8366%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 10